{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the `sigma_a ~ cauchy(0, 2.5)` prior to occur before `alpha ~ normal(mu_a, sigma_a)`, because `sigma_a` is used in the `alpha` prior and SafeStan requires each parameter to be sampled from its prior before model-block use. This is a same-density reordering of additive log-density terms. No data changes were made.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N;
  int<lower=1> J; // number of counties
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=J> county;
  vector[N] x;
  vector[N] y;
}
transformed data {
  matrix[N, 1] cov = [x']';
}
parameters {
  vector[1] beta;
  real mu_a;
  real<lower=0> sigma_a;
  real<lower=0> sigma_y;
  vector<offset=mu_a, multiplier=sigma_a>[J] alpha;
}
model {
  beta ~ std_normal();
  mu_a ~ std_normal();
  sigma_a ~ cauchy(0, 2.5);
  alpha ~ normal(mu_a, sigma_a);
  sigma_y ~ cauchy(0, 2.5);

  y ~ normal_id_glm(cov, alpha[county], beta, sigma_y);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"J":3,"N":1,"county":[1],"x":[6.298555760013877],"y":[1.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
